      <title>台积电加速扩充2纳米产能：2027年中月产能目标11万片</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/chiptech/post/20260914/%E5%8F%B0%E7%A7%AF%E7%94%B5%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%9F%E6%89%A9%E5%85%852%E7%BA%B3%E7%B1%B3%E4%BA%A7%E8%83%BD2027%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%88%E4%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%8711%E4%B8%87%E7%89%87/</link>
